#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html.ex:236
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Administrator, All members and roles you make yourself, with 19 permissions: from writing and sending files to creating events and editing the group. A sub-group takes over its parent's roles or has its own."
msgstr "Administrator, Svi i uloge koje sam napraviš, sa 19 dozvola: od pisanja i slanja fajlova do pravljenja događaja i uređivanja grupe. Podgrupa preuzima uloge roditelja ili ima svoje."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html.ex:209
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Replies with a quote, threads for longer conversations, reactions and @mentions of people or whole roles. Links get a preview, and you can edit a message too. You can open the chat of a public group, so that those who are not members write there too. You can start a poll right in the chat, and everyone votes from there."
msgstr "Odgovori sa citatom, niti za duže razgovore, reakcije i @pominjanje ljudi ili celih uloga. Linkovi dobijaju pregled, a poruku možeš i da izmeniš. Razgovor javne grupe možeš da otvoriš, pa u njemu pišu i oni koji nisu članovi. U razgovoru možeš da pokreneš i glasanje, pa svi glasaju odmah tu."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/live/group_live/show.ex:998
