#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html.ex:245
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A group's description doesn't have to be just text. It can also be a small app, say a form, a poll or a task list. Or pick a template, say news or an event, and fill in the fields."
msgstr "Opis grupe ne mora da bude samo tekst. Može da bude i mala aplikacija, na primer forma, anketa ili spisak zaduženja. Ili izaberi šablon, na primer vest ili događaj, i popuni polja."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html.ex:200
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Branch out your groups as far as you need. Each one is public or private, a sub-group can inherit members and roles, and unread counts add up through the whole tree. You can react to a group just as you do to a message. You start a new group from a ready setup: chat, folder, announcements, feed, polls, form, map or page. You can then narrow the list of sub-groups by kind, to the groups you are in, or to those you created. You can put a group on a map, with a pin you pick for it. The map of groups shows every group with a place that you can see, and you narrow it with the same filters, by time and by pin. You can also draw a group an area, like a local community's, and the map then shows what lies in it and which areas a place lies in. A search finds a group even when you type its name without diacritics, in Latin or in Cyrillic."
msgstr "Granaj grupe koliko god treba. Svaka je javna ili privatna, podgrupa može da nasledi članove i uloge, a broj nepročitanih poruka sabira se kroz celo stablo. Na grupu možeš da reaguješ kao i na poruku. Novu grupu počinješ od gotove postavke: chat, folder, obaveštenja, feed, glasanja, forma, mapa ili stranica. Listu podgrupa posle sužavaš po vrsti, po tome gde si član ili čiji si autor. Grupu možeš da staviš na mapu, sa pinom koji joj izabereš. Mapa grupa prikazuje sve grupe sa mestom koje vidiš, a sužavaš je istim filterima, po vremenu i po pinu. Grupi možeš da nacrtaš i područje, kao mesnoj zajednici, pa na mapi vidiš šta je u njemu i u kojim područjima je neko mesto. Pretraga nalazi grupu i kad joj ime ukucaš bez kvačica, latinicom ili ćirilicom."

